From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.networking.hostname: Windows.Networking.EndpointPair (3667)

windows.networking.hostname: Windows.Networking.EndpointPair

The DLL serves the EndpointPair class: IEndpointPairFactory.CreateEndpointPair
and an IEndpointPair that holds the local and remote host names and service
names (all four are settable; hosts are reference counted).
---
diff --git a/dlls/windows.networking.hostname/Makefile.in b/dlls/windows.networking.hostname/Makefile.in
index aa3b824..f271cbe 100644
--- a/dlls/windows.networking.hostname/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/windows.networking.hostname/Makefile.in
@@ -3,5 +3,6 @@ IMPORTS = combase ntdll
 
 SOURCES = \
 	classes.idl \
+	endpointpair.c \
 	hostname.c \
 	main.c
diff --git a/dlls/windows.networking.hostname/endpointpair.c b/dlls/windows.networking.hostname/endpointpair.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..498c021
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/windows.networking.hostname/endpointpair.c
@@ -0,0 +1,386 @@
